rink\",\n        \"drinking\",\n        \"drank\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"drinks\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 7,\n      \"question\": \"Which sentence is grammatically correct?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"There are many people in the room.\",\n        \"There is many people in the room.\",\n        \"There are many peoples in the room.\",\n        \"There is a many people in the room.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"There are many people in the room.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 8,\n      \"question\": \"Complete the sentence with the correct word: \\\"I would like ______ apple, please.\\\"\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"an\",\n        \"a\",\n        \"the\",\n        \"two\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"an\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 9,\n      \"question\": \"Which sentence shows the correct use of 'because'?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"I am happy because I have a test.\",\n        \"I am happy because I passed the test.\",\n        \"I am happy because I study hard.\",\n        \"I am happy because I didn't study.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"I am happy because I passed the test.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 10,\n      \"question\": \"Select the correct form of the verb: \\\"They ______ to the park last weekend.\\\"\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"go\",\n        \"went\",\n        \"gone\",\n        \"going\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"went\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
